# FRP 分区路径补建：让 PersistentDataBlockService 与 OemLockService 找得到 ro.frp.pst 指向的节点。
on post-fs-data
    chmod 0660 /dev/block/vda3
    chown root system /dev/block/vda3
    mkdir /dev/block/by-name 0755 root root
    symlink /dev/block/vda3 /dev/block/by-name/frp
    mkdir /dev/block/bootdevice 0755 root root
    mkdir /dev/block/bootdevice/by-name 0755 root root
    symlink /dev/block/vda3 /dev/block/bootdevice/by-name/frp
